{
  "$comment": [
    "The prototype's 20 distinct cards / 103 copies, extracted from",
    "prototype/lootbox-prototype.html, ready to seed a room's deck.",
    "",
    "`name` is the power-up name shown in the activity log, notifications and",
    "inventory. Editable at any time from the educator card page; past activity",
    "events keep the name they recorded, so renaming never rewrites history.",
    "",
    "`effect_text` is optional - the card art states the effect and educators",
    "know it from the name. Fill it in only where a note would help.",
    "",
    "`source_url` is the original Google Drive link, kept for the one-time image",
    "import only. It is never served to users: the importer downloads each file,",
    "stores it in object storage, and writes `image_key` on the card. See",
    "docs/ARCHITECTURE.md section 6 for why Drive links cannot be the runtime source."
  ],
